# Riding on the Clouds (jeuno 131): the kinds of its Maat replies, against Maat's own script (the fallback: Maat.lua
# plays 117 while the char var BeatAroundTheBushin is 5, and its finish sets it to 6). A quest event takes turns with
# the fallback (the quest's turn, then the script's); a progressEvent wins on the script's turn too. A level 61 Warrior
# at level cap 65, MAX_LEVEL 99, BeatAroundTheBushin 5 and the quest accepted (a GM, before login). Accepted, no stone:
# 89 (an event: the quest's turn), then 117 (the script's turn); BeatAroundTheBushin 5 again (a GM); 89 (the quest's
# turn). The quest set available (a GM) on the script's turn: 88 all the same (a progressEvent). Accepted again (a GM):
# 89 (the turn after a progressEvent is the quest's), the four stones (a GM), then on the script's turn: 90 (a
# progressEvent), finished: completed.
lists RuludeGardens/Maat/onTrigger RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/88 RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/90
char zone=RuludeGardens pos=12.4,3.1,119.5 job=WAR lvl=61
levelcap 65
charvar BeatAroundTheBushin 5
quest Jeuno.RidingOnTheClouds accepted
login
trigger Maat                            # accepted, no stone: event 89 (the quest's turn)
finish
trigger Maat                            # the script's turn: Maat.lua's 117 (BeatAroundTheBushin 5)
finish                                  # Maat.lua: BeatAroundTheBushin 6
charvar BeatAroundTheBushin 5           # a GM
trigger Maat                            # the quest's turn: 89
finish
quest Jeuno.RidingOnTheClouds available # a GM
trigger Maat                            # the script's turn, but 88 is a progressEvent: 88 (the vars drawn)
finish option=0                         # the four vars set to 0
quest Jeuno.RidingOnTheClouds accepted  # a GM
trigger Maat                            # after a progressEvent, the quest's turn: 89 (the vars 0)
finish
keyitem ScowlingStone                   # a GM: the four stones
keyitem SmilingStone
keyitem SomberStone
keyitem SpiritedStone
trigger Maat                            # the script's turn, but 90 is a progressEvent: 90
finish                                  # completed: Cloud Breaker, the stones taken, level cap 70
